                                "sense_id": "13bc31e8-0f05-3d61-b3b3-5a6dfe16170c",
                                "text": "1984, Garrie Hutchinson, A Practice Game at the Old Home Ground, from From the Outer, reprinted 2001, David Headon (editor), The Best Ever Australian Sports Writing: A 200 Year Collection, page 289,\nThe fans seem happy to be back, finding their formerly favourite possies in the stands, or around the strangely sunken perimeter fence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7eff3a25-9936-43bf-889c-21186471b6bb",
                                "sense_id": "13bc31e8-0f05-3d61-b3b3-5a6dfe16170c",
                                "text": "1998, Business Review Weekly, Volume 20, Issues 47-49, page 102,\nOf course, it helps if you are very rich and regularly pay more than $40,000 for a couture outfit to be guaranteed of a near-front-row possie at the bi-annual parades (winter and summer collections)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3da28275-fdcf-4f84-97c9-32c8ac3028de",
                                "sense_id": "13bc31e8-0f05-3d61-b3b3-5a6dfe16170c",
                                "text": "It′s in a good people-watching possie and if you have an early dinner between 3pm and 7pm you get a 40% discount."
                            }
                        ]
